# ZebraSGDCommands - Utility Methods Only

## Rule: ZebraSGDCommands Contains ONLY Utility Methods

The [ZebraSGDCommands](mdc:lib/zebra_sgd_commands.dart) class **MUST** contain ONLY utility methods for data detection and parsing. It **MUST NOT** contain any command string generation methods.

## Allowed Methods

### Data Format Detection
- `isZPLData(String data)` - Detect if data is ZPL format
- `isCPCLData(String data)` - Detect if data is CPCL format
- `detectDataLanguage(String data)` - Determine print format from data

### Response Parsing
- `parseResponse(String response)` - Parse SGD response to extract value

## Forbidden Methods

The following types of methods are **NEVER** allowed in ZebraSGDCommands:

### Command Generation
- `getCommand(String setting)` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `setCommand(String setting, String value)` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `doCommand(String action, String value)` - Use CommandFactory instead

### Mode Commands
- `setZPLMode()` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `setCPCLMode()` - Use CommandFactory instead

### Control Commands
- `resetPrinter()` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `unpausePrinter()` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `resumePrinter()` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `clearAlerts()` - Use CommandFactory instead

### Format-Specific Commands
- `zplResume()`, `zplClearErrors()`, `zplClearBuffer()`, `zplFlushBuffer()` - Use CommandFactory instead
- `cpclClearBuffer()`, `cpclFlushBuffer()`, `cpclClearErrors()` - Use CommandFactory instead

## Implementation Requirements

### File Structure
The file **MUST** contain only:
```dart
class ZebraSGDCommands {
  // ✅ UTILITY METHODS ONLY
  static bool isZPLData(String data) { ... }
  static bool isCPCLData(String data) { ... }
  static PrintFormat? detectDataLanguage(String data) { ... }
  static String? parseResponse(String response) { ... }
}
```

### Import Requirements
- **MUST** import only necessary dependencies for utility operations
- **MUST NOT** import command-related files
- **MUST NOT** import printer interface files

### Method Requirements
- **MUST** be static methods
- **MUST** be pure utility functions (no side effects)
- **MUST** handle null/empty input gracefully
- **MUST** return appropriate types (bool, String?, PrintFormat?)

## Usage Patterns

### ✅ CORRECT - Utility Methods Only
```dart
// Data format detection
if (ZebraSGDCommands.isZPLData(data)) {
  // Handle ZPL format
}

// Format detection
final format = ZebraSGDCommands.detectDataLanguage(data);

// Response parsing
final value = ZebraSGDCommands.parseResponse(response);
```

### ❌ WRONG - Command Operations
```dart
// ❌ NEVER do this - Command generation belongs in CommandFactory
final command = ZebraSGDCommands.zplClearErrors();
final sgd = ZebraSGDCommands.getCommand('device.languages');
ZebraSGDCommands.setZPLMode();
```

## Integration with Command System

### With CommandFactory
```dart
// Use ZebraSGDCommands for detection, CommandFactory for commands
if (ZebraSGDCommands.isZPLData(data)) {
  await CommandFactory.createSendZplClearBufferCommand(printer).execute();
} else if (ZebraSGDCommands.isCPCLData(data)) {
  await CommandFactory.createSendCpclClearBufferCommand(printer).execute();
}
```

### With ParserUtil
```dart
// Combine with ParserUtil for type conversion
final response = ZebraSGDCommands.parseResponse(sgdResponse);
final isPaused = ParserUtil.toBool(response) ?? false;
```

## Enforcement

### Code Review Checklist
- [ ] Only utility methods present
- [ ] No command generation methods
- [ ] No printer interface dependencies
- [ ] Methods are static and pure
- [ ] Proper null handling
- [ ] Appropriate return types

### Violation Examples
```dart
// ❌ VIOLATIONS - These should not exist in ZebraSGDCommands
class ZebraSGDCommands {
  static String zplClearErrors() { ... } // WRONG - Command generation
  static String getCommand(String setting) { ... } // WRONG - Command generation
  static void setZPLMode() { ... } // WRONG - Command generation
}
```

